+/// The binaries the distribution ships — the one declaration every pipeline stage
+/// must agree with. Pure — `xtask/tests/dist_templates.rs` pins its shape and runs
+/// the pipeline-file checker of `xtask/tests/dist_two_binary_layout.rs` over it.
